Runs a dedicated outbound worker paired with the hosted `LeptosKit` app

Usage: leptoskit console worker --url <URL> --project <PROJECT> --data <DATA>

Options:
      --url <URL>          
      --project <PROJECT>  
      --data <DATA>        
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
